 :tiers
 {:hard "Approved parity in the declared model representation. The minimum shared-interior event match rate is 99.0%; exact comparisons and bounded, enumerated residuals at or above that threshold are both hard parity. Every residual and representation restriction remains mandatory evidence."
  :minimum-match-rate 0.99
  :match-rate-rule "matched events divided by max(matched + live-only interior, matched + historical-only interior), after declared field exclusions and event-time intersection"
  :excluded "Observed residuals are too large for either corpus tier."}

